@@ -80,6 +80,20 @@
 
 ## Working Rules
 
+- Agents choose research strategy, tools and depth within the authorized task,
+  and repair ordinary errors in the same session. Formatting, harmless extra
+  metadata, equivalent date precision, expected pending usage and arbitrary
+  result counts must not end useful work.
+- Preserve original evidence and provenance when normalizing an input. Return
+  actionable validation errors; quarantine only the unsupported claim or
+  affected record where possible and continue with the valid evidence. Never
+  invent facts, silently drop evidence or treat a context/page size as a success
+  quota.
+- Retain consequential controls: the user's spending authority, access/security
+  and deletion approvals, idempotency and duplicate effects, and opt-outs.
+  The current outreach direction remains draft-only with no prospect sends;
+  agent autonomy grants neither external sends nor unlimited spend.
+
 - Preserve truthful product language around hosted sessions, captures, rights, and provenance.
 - Prefer only edits that strengthen Arm Decision Proof partner intake,
   authorization, durable experiment state, inspectable evidence, or bounded
