 Local conventions:
 
+- Apply root's agent-autonomy rule in runtime behavior: repair harmless input
+  differences, preserve source evidence, and keep valid sibling records usable
+  when an optional claim fails. Validation should identify the affected record
+  and repair needed without logging private content. Page relevant authorized
+  history rather than stopping at a result count; retain spending/access,
+  opt-out, idempotency and current draft-only controls.
+
 - Start route mapping in `server/routes.ts`; start app/middleware/rate-limit/CSP questions in `server/index.ts`.
